{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24555","headline":"杨六尚书频寄新诗诗中多有思闲相就之志因书鄙意报而谕之 · 白居易","name":"杨六尚书频寄新诗诗中多有思闲相就之志因书鄙意报而谕之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君年殊未及悬车，未合将闲逐老夫。\n身健正宜金印绶，位高方称白髭须。\n若论尘事何由了，但问云心自在无。\n进退是非俱是梦，丘中阙下亦何殊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24555.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24555","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}